From 507e7427685649c16211ce999c16a34e0fc156d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anurag Dhote <anuragdhote392@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:30:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): macOS-style traffic lights in the Linux top
 bar

Linux windows drop Electron's window controls overlay and draw close,
minimize and maximize as traffic lights in T3's own top bar, using the
same left inset macOS reserves for its native buttons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
